# Paths that need a human (the founder) to review and merge.
# A PR that changes any of them fails the security-gate check, gets the
# needs-founder label, and is NOT auto-merged. CI must still be green.
#
# One glob per line, matched against the full repo-relative path,
# case-insensitive. Blank lines and lines starting with # are ignored.
#   *    any characters except /
#   **   any characters including / ("**/" also matches zero directories)
#   ?    one character except /
#   !    at the start of a line: exclude. The LAST matching line wins, so
#        put exclusions after the rule they carve out of.
# Renames count: the old path is checked too.

.github/**
**/auth/**
**/permissions/**
**/*token*
**/*secret*
**/.env*
**/Dockerfile*
**/docker-compose*
**/package.json
**/package-lock.json

# Design tokens are not credentials: exclude them from **/*token* above.
!**/styles/tokens.css
!**/theme/tokens.ts
